{"sections":[{"slug":"旋量丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"旋量丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">旋量丛</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“旋量丛”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/旋量群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">旋量群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的不可约表示通过</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/关联丛","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">关联丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的构造对应于基本的旋量丛</span>.</p>\n<p>$4$ <span lang=\"zh\">维情形</span>:\n$$\r\n\\mathbb{R}^{3+1}\\otimes \\mathbb{C} \\simeq \\underset{A}{\\mathbb{C}^2} \\otimes \\underset{A'}{\\widetilde {\\mathbb{C}}^2},\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\widetilde {SO_o(1,3)} \\simeq SL(2,\\mathbb{C})\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Weyl张量","text":"Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">张量</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/零迹Ricci张量","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">零迹</span> Ricci <span lang=\"zh\">张量</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">都对应某些表示</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">相关</span>: "},{"Local":{"url":"/twistor理论","text":"twistor <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">自旋度量</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">使用下标</span> $a=AA'$,\n$$\r\ng_{ab}=g_{AA'BB'}=\\epsilon_{AB}\\overline{\\epsilon_{A'B'}},\r\n$$\n$\\nabla_{BB'}\\Pi_A$ <span lang=\"zh\">在两个不可约表示上的分量分别为</span> $\\nabla_{B'(B}\\Pi_{A)}$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $\\nabla_{B'B}\\Pi_A \\epsilon^{BA} = \\nabla_{B'}^{A}\\Pi_A$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}